MEET YOU AT /630
-YOU WERE EARLY.
YES, CAPTAIN,
MY MISTAKE.
I'M HERE TO
BRIEF YOU ON
OPERATION
V7B. JUMP
DOWN, EVE
CAPTAIN WINGS,
MEET MISS EVE
MARLOW A NEWS
REEL HOUND. SHE
KEPT CRANKING
WHILE I KEPT
PRAYING!
AND CAPTAIN, YOU
SHOULD SEE THE
SHOTS I GOT
THEY'RE WONDER
FUL!
WONDERFUL
EH PERHAPS
THAT KID
OVER THERE
WOULD EN-
JOY A SPECIAL
PREVIEW.
WHY HE'S
YEA-THINK IT
WOUNDED. OVER, MISS
MARLOW. NOW
LIEUTENANT,
LET'S GET ON
WITH THE BUS-
INESS.
IT'S AN EXPERI-
MENTAL RAID
CAPTAIN. OUR
CARRIER WILL
BE READY AT
0635.
A RAID_I
- CAN'T MISS
THAT! AH-
THERE'S SOME
ATMOSPHERE
MATERIAL-
SMILE NOW
BOYS MAYBE
YOUR GIRLS
