I WANT A PIC OF IT.
SORRY, MISS
MARLOW BUT
THAT'S AGAINST
ORDERS. ANYWAY
IT WAS DAMAGED IN
THE FIGHT AND IT'S
BEING PREPAIRED.
SUCH A BUSINESS_I
SUPPOSE THE OLD SOUR
PUSS GAVE ORDERS NOT
TO LET ME TAKE THE
